>l?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FVarId</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">none</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MetaM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MVarId</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">l?</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">some</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fvar</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lctx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">goal</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getDecl</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lctx</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">modifyLocalDecl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fvar</span>\n<span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">setType</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tgt</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">goal</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">modifyLCtx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↦</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lctx</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">pure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">goal</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">none</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">goal</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">replaceTargetDefEq</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tgt</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AOrB</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AOrB</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">cases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">h</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">setm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">trivial</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n</div></div>",
        "id": 598701413,
        "sender_full_name": "Lua Viana Reis",
        "timestamp": 1780132621
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The code you posted appears to be introducing</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">B</span>\n<span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">?</span><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"bp\">✝</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>at the <code>setm ?A + ?B = _</code> so the metavariable <code>?A</code> introduced after <code>cases h</code> is still a problem.</p>\n<p>I think the issue stems from <code>if absTgt.hasLooseBVars</code> returning <code>false</code> when the metavariable is already declared (e.g. <code>?A</code>) and <code>true</code> when the mvar is fresh (e.g. <code>?a</code>).</p>\n<p>You say you are not advocating for the code, so I'm curious where did you get it from?</p>",
        "id": 598714897,
        "sender_full_name": "Niklas Halonen",
        "timestamp": 1780144110
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I am not familiar with this side of Lean, and I could imagine there was a better way to do that</p>",
        "id": 599112148,
        "sender_full_name": "Lua Viana Reis",
        "timestamp": 1780306852
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>To be more specific, I think it's not nice that the method created a new syntax that could be used outside the tactic. Instead I would prefer to make the existing <code>?hole</code> syntax elaborate differently only inside the tactic, for which I have an idea now: it should be possible to replace only the syntax node kind of the <code>?hole</code>s with a custom one, and register only the elaborator for this custom kind (and not a syntax)</p>",
        "id": 603521518,
        "sender_full_name": "Lua Viana Reis",
        "timestamp": 1781563315
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I opened a draft <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/40679\">#40679</a> with a new rewritten version (and more tests)!</p>",
