    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"571941\">@Lua Viana Reis</span> I tried out <code>setm</code> from your PR and it seems to work well even when the metavariable names like <code>A</code>/<code>B</code> are already in scope (via splitting into cases on the <code>AOrB</code> hypothesis)!</p>\n<p>I feel like this tactic could be \"production ready\" at some point, but with my lack of understanding of metaprogramming, I can't really evaluate it properly. I'll try it out in various situations over the coming weeks to see if it holds up.</p>",
